#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectcompressor.rst:16 0308072fc9c3450197699b35146b6aae
msgid "Dynamic range compressor for reducing the dynamic range of audio signals."
msgstr "动态压缩器。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectcompressor.rst:21 3aaf43ddbb06440d8b853d02b57e1ab2
msgid "Description"
msgstr "描述"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectcompressor.rst:23 7b198fa9335a46c4bfec7700da0874e5
msgid ""
"FmodAudioEffectCompressor is a dynamic range compression effect that reduces the volume of loud "
"sounds while leaving quiet sounds unchanged. It is commonly used to control dynamics, prevent "
"clipping, and make audio more consistent in loudness."
msgstr ""
"**FmodAudioEffectCompressor**    用于压低超过阈值的动态范围，并可通过输出增益补偿响度。   ``threshold_db``    决定开始压缩的位置，   "
"``ratio``    决定压缩强度，   ``attack_us``    和    ``release_ms``    控制响应速度，   ``mix``    可用于并行压缩。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectcompressor.rst:25 cf9ba0c9b042433b98a13d762a489449
msgid ""
"The compressor works by measuring the input level and reducing gain when it exceeds a specified "
"threshold. The amount of reduction is determined by the ratio, and the response time is "
"controlled by attack and release parameters."
msgstr "压缩器检测输入电平，并在超过阈值时降低增益。压缩比决定增益衰减量，启动和释放参数决定响应速度。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectcompressor.rst:27 7201aea185b447cbb6995f539027fba9
msgid ""
"This effect can also apply gain makeup to compensate for the volume reduction caused by "
"compression, and supports sidechain input for ducking and other advanced techniques."
msgstr "支持补偿增益，用于弥补压缩造成的音量降低；也支持侧链输入，可实现闪避等处理。"

