msgid ""
"The compression ratio, which determines how much the signal is compressed when it exceeds the "
"threshold. Range: 1.0 to 50.0. Default: 4.0. A ratio of 4:1 means that for every 4 dB the input "
"exceeds the threshold, the output increases by only 1 dB. Higher ratios result in more aggressive"
" compression."
msgstr "压缩比"

