msgid ""
"The attack time in microseconds (μs). This is the time it takes for the compressor to start "
"reducing gain after the input signal exceeds the threshold. Range: 0 to 100000 μs (100 ms). "
"Default: 20000 μs (20 ms). Shorter attack times respond faster but may cause distortion; longer "
"times preserve transients."
msgstr "启动时间，单位为微秒"

