#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectcompressor.rst:179 9b26457009d1452482cfdec90afee727
msgid ""
"The release time in milliseconds (ms). This is the time it takes for the compressor to return to "
"unity gain after the input signal falls below the threshold. Range: 10 ms to 10000 ms. Default: "
"250 ms. Longer release times produce smoother, more natural results; shorter times may cause "
"pumping artifacts."
msgstr "释放时间，单位为毫秒"

